s to import, in which order, to exercise both directions of the potential cycle).","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f0ff25681b95a20e7","impact":0.44,"is_primary":null,"location":"Acceptance criteria, AC line 2: 'a test or a clean python -c \"import ...\" proves there is no circular import between the two modules'","norm_id":"na53f65742bdf59a0","priority":0.33,"reason":"default-advisory","scenarios":["Agent runs `python -c 'import retry'` alone, which does not exercise the transport→retry import direction","Agent relies on test discovery passing as a proxy, which proves only that test collection doesn't cycle, not that the two modules can be imported independently and in either order"],"severity":"minor","suggested_fix":"python -c 'import sys, importlib; importlib.import_module(\"rebar._engine.rebar_reconciler.adapters.jira_datacenter.retry\"); importlib.import_module(\"rebar._engine.rebar_reconciler.adapters.jira_datacenter.transport\"); print(\"no circular import\")'","tier":"LLM","validity":0.75,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"underspecified_oracle","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"none","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"low"}}},{"block_threshold":0.95,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Add a concrete pyte